    "detailed_description": "<h1>See also</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Hope is Gone is a first-person action horror game with a retro art style.<br><br>You play as Zoe, an ordinary woman who has made many mistakes in the past. Zoe takes a bus to go to the hospital where her husband is hospitalized, but falls asleep. When she wakes up, she is in a totally decadent and dark parallel dimension. The beings of this world hate humans and will do anything to capture Zoe and any other human.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival-horror:</h2> The inhabitants of this decadent world will come after you, fight to defend yourself or run away to save resources. Don't get lost. Stay alert.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore:</h2> This decadent world is very different from ours, explore the environments to find routes to your destination and look for items that will help you survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover:</h2> There are many secrets hidden in this strange world. In fact, there are also many dark secrets in Zoe's past. Discover the secrets and understand your destiny.",
    "about_the_game": "Hope is Gone is a first-person action horror game with a retro art style.<br><br>You play as Zoe, an ordinary woman who has made many mistakes in the past. Zoe takes a bus to go to the hospital where her husband is hospitalized, but falls asleep. When she wakes up, she is in a totally decadent and dark parallel dimension. The beings of this world hate humans and will do anything to capture Zoe and any other human.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival-horror:</h2> The inhabitants of this decadent world will come after you, fight to defend yourself or run away to save resources. Don't get lost. Stay alert.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore:</h2> This decadent world is very different from ours, explore the environments to find routes to your destination and look for items that will help you survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover:</h2> There are many secrets hidden in this strange world. In fact, there are also many dark secrets in Zoe's past. Discover the secrets and understand your destiny.",
    "short_description": "A retro-style first-person horror game set in a dark, decaying parallel dimension where people from our world are not welcome.",
